    "evidence_summary": "LangChain documents short-term and long-term memory concepts, including LangGraph long-term memories stored as JSON documents under namespaces and keys.；Letta documents persistent memory blocks that are always visible in the agent context window.；Mem0 separates memory into layers so agents remember the right detail at the right time and avoid over-fetching.；OWASP recommends validating and sanitizing data before storing agent memory, isolating memory, setting expiration and size limits, auditing sensitive data, and using cryptographic integrity checks.；Defines MemoryItem v0.1, memory types, lifecycle, source, write_policy, security, retrieval and integrity fields.",
